{"case_id": "u-en-01", "question": "What is the mandatory retirement age for faculty members?", "id": "u-en-01-original", "kind": "original", "answer": "The mandatory retirement age for faculty members is 67 years old, as of the date they reach this age. However, for those who work at Devlet universities, Kafkas University, and Kütahya Health Sciences University, the mandatory retirement age is 75 years old, provided they started their employment after these institutions were established. This exception applies until December 31, 2025."}
