{"case_id": "u-en-02", "question": "How many members does the Council of Higher Education have?", "id": "u-en-02-original", "kind": "original", "answer": "The Council of Higher Education consists of a total of 21 members. This includes:\n\n- 7 professors selected from among those who have rendered successful service in rectorship and teaching positions, chosen by the Council.\n- 7 individuals selected from among state officials or civil servants who have distinguished themselves, also chosen by the Council.\n- 7 professors selected from among non-members of the Council by the Council itself."}
